---
layout: layouts/base.njk
htmlLang: en
ogLocale: en_US
title: Formats — Luxury Cover Band
description: "Live formats by Luxury Cover Band: choir collaboration, corporate home band, live karaoke, welcome program and a campfire guitarist."
permalink: /en/formats/
---

<section class="page-hero page-hero--list">
	<div class="container container--narrow">
		<p class="page-hero__breadcrumb"><a href="{{ '/en/' | url }}">{{ site.shortName }}</a> <span>·</span><span>Formats</span></p>
		<p class="page-hero__eyebrow">Five formats</p>
		<h1 class="page-hero__title">Live formats<br><span class="muted">for your event.</span></h1>
		<p class="page-hero__lead">From choir collaborations and live karaoke to a welcome set or intimate songs by the fire.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<section class="section section--light">
	<div class="container reveal">
		<ul class="formats">
			{% for f in enContent.formats %}
			<li class="format">
				<a class="format__link" href="{{ ('/en/formats/' + f.slug + '/') | url }}">
					<div class="format__photo"><img src="{{ ('/' + f.poster) | url }}" alt="{{ f.title }} — LC Band format" loading="lazy"></div>
					<div class="format__body">
						<span class="format__label">{{ f.eyebrow }}</span>
						<h3 class="format__title">{{ f.title }}</h3>
						<p class="format__text">{{ f.lead }}</p>
						<span class="format__more">Learn more ›</span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</li>
			{% endfor %}
		</ul>
	</div>
</section>
